  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 打造的模組。充滿愛意製作。為 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>隱藏配方書是一款簡單的客戶端模組，可切換所有製作介面中的配方按鈕顯示狀態。無需安裝於伺服器端。內建若干設定選項，用於控制訊息發送時機與功能停用。同樣適用於熔爐介面。<br><br>提供快捷鍵（預設為 Tab 鍵），可切換配方按鈕的顯示狀態。在顯示製作格時按下即可生效。它與玩家列表共用同一快捷鍵，但不會互相干擾。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"運行環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>展開詳細設定</summary>\n<p><span><strong>shouldHideRecipeBook</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>首次啟動客戶端時是否預設隱藏配方書。<br><br><span><strong>allowRecipeBookToggleHotkey</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>是否允許使用快捷鍵切換配方書的顯示狀態。<br><br><span><strong>showMessageOnRecipeBookToggle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false<br>是否在每次顯示或隱藏配方書時傳送訊息。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>功能說明：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>快捷鍵（預設為 Tab）：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"508\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>按下快捷鍵時：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"496\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可在任何整合包中自由使用本模組，前提是下載來源必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、建議或想法，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
